      "defect": "MutatingWebhookConfiguration uses failurePolicy: Ignore.\n",
      "infection": "When the webhook service is unreachable — certificate expired, service scaled to zero, DNS resolution failure, network partition — the API server skips mutation and admits the pod as-is. Sidecar injection (Istio, Linkerd, Vault Agent) stops silently. Security proxies, logging agents, and policy sidecars are absent from newly created pods. Existing pods with sidecars continue working, masking the gap until the next rollout.\n",
      "failure": "Silent sidecar absence. Pods run without expected mutation. Service mesh traffic bypasses mTLS. Secrets injection fails. The failure is invisible until a dependent system breaks or an audit reveals the gap.\n",
      "delta": [
        {
          "property_label": "webhook failure policy",
          "property_path": "k8s.webhook.failure_policy",
          "current_value": "Ignore",
          "fix_action": "change from \"Ignore\" to any other value, or remove"
        }
      ],
